      "ordinal": 1,
      "chunk_sha256": "af8cb22b12cba93d28384d7f6927e8606398670ca75023fe0f37e4e77cd068e9",
      "outcome": "evidence",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000001-af8cb22b12cb:assertion:80:204:7f80a1bc45af",
          "text": "REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use `superpowers:executing-plans` task-by-task. Skill changes follow `superpowers:writing-skills` + TDD.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 80,
          "chunk_byte_end": 204
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000001-af8cb22b12cb:assertion:215:402:94b61f8ce6e3",
          "text": "Make exhaustive, evidenced document traversal the primary enforceable invariant by shipping portable extractors and deriving source-coverage DoD from the extractor-emitted chunk universe.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 215,
          "chunk_byte_end": 402
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000001-af8cb22b12cb:assertion:508:633:780e580d1284",
          "text": "Each extractor emits the complete ordered text-chunk universe with content hashes and contiguous normalized UTF-8 byte spans.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 508,
          "chunk_byte_end": 633
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000001-af8cb22b12cb:assertion:634:747:a9bd77f47a47",
          "text": "A single machine ledger, `chunk-evidence.json`, records exactly one verification verdict for every emitted chunk.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 634,
          "chunk_byte_end": 747
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000001-af8cb22b12cb:assertion:748:920:17beb57ab0a5",
          "text": "`verify_run.py` derives required coverage from the manifest, rejects any missing/extra/duplicate chunk evidence, and refuses Done before the complete manifest is evidenced.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 748,
          "chunk_byte_end": 920
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000001-af8cb22b12cb:assertion:921:1028:042c93a0611a",
          "text": "Format-specific visual/structural QA remains a separate predicate and is never replaced by text extraction.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 921,
          "chunk_byte_end": 1028
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000001-af8cb22b12cb:assertion:1054:1091:45c934cfc878",
          "text": "`103 passed` before this remediation.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 1054,
          "chunk_byte_end": 1091
        }
      ],
      "constraints": []
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "markdown-000002-0935af6dec34",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "chunk_sha256": "0935af6dec344e2db864b885c8861b934c2d4dd644bb370aef927a170bc0b9d0",
      "outcome": "evidence",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000002-0935af6dec34:assertion:24:58:79b7a487b164",
          "text": "Canonical root remains `SKILL.md`.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 24,
          "chunk_byte_end": 58
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000002-0935af6dec34:assertion:61:119:3d8b69c4194a",
          "text": "Freeze remains held until frozen-byte verification passes.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 61,
          "chunk_byte_end": 119
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000002-0935af6dec34:assertion:122:192:9280fbefc641",
          "text": "Portable extraction scripts must not depend on `/home/oai/skills/...`.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 122,
          "chunk_byte_end": 192
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000002-0935af6dec34:assertion:195:340:a6dcb8407a61",
          "text": "Installer remains stdlib-only; extraction helpers may use optional local parsing backends but must fail clearly when no supported backend exists.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 195,
          "chunk_byte_end": 340
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000002-0935af6dec34:assertion:343:423:d4344221b49e",
          "text": "HTML, DOCX, and Markdown extraction must work with Python standard library only.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 343,
          "chunk_byte_end": 423
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000002-0935af6dec34:assertion:426:514:49665c7a6a46",
          "text": "PDF extraction supports environment-detected backends; no internal OAI path is required.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 426,
          "chunk_byte_end": 514
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000002-0935af6dec34:assertion:517:631:31ca6fa1b3b5",
          "text": "Every emitted chunk gets stable id, ordinal, locator, content hash, normalized extracted-text byte span, and text.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 517,
          "chunk_byte_end": 631
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000002-0935af6dec34:assertion:634:730:96a052749a9a",
          "text": "Chunk spans must cover the emitted normalized text stream contiguously with no gaps or overlaps.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 634,
          "chunk_byte_end": 730
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000002-0935af6dec34:assertion:733:844:b232aab401f4",
          "text": "Atomic Markdown fences/tables are never split; oversize atomic blocks remain one chunk and are marked oversize.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 733,
          "chunk_byte_end": 844
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000002-0935af6dec34:assertion:847:965:71c44cfb8cc8",
          "text": "One machine evidence record per chunk: `facts`, `constraints`, or explicit `non_match`; empty/ambiguous verdicts fail.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 847,
          "chunk_byte_end": 965
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000002-0935af6dec34:assertion:968:1098:8bdc8967d0f9",
          "text": "`coverage.required` and `coverage.completed` may exist for reporting but must exactly mirror manifest/evidence, never define them.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 968,
          "chunk_byte_end": 1098
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "markdown-000002-0935af6dec34:assertion:1101:1222:e9a43e21b30c",
          "text": "PDF/DOCX visual/layout truth remains governed by format QA; exhaustive text traversal does not claim visual completeness.",
          "chunk_byte_start": 1101,
          "chunk_byte_end": 1222
        }
      ],
      "constraints": []
